## Attribution Requirements

When using this software, you must:

1. **Include the copyright notice** in all copies or substantial portions of the software
2. **Include the license text** in all copies or substantial portions of the software
3. **Preserve all copyright notices** in the source code

### Recommended Attribution Format

For web applications, include in your about page or footer:
```
Powered by Django REST Framework SAAS Starter Kit
Licensed under MIT License
```

For documentation or README files:
```markdown
This project is based on the Django REST Framework SAAS Starter Kit
(https://github.com/akhshyganesh/docker-django-starter-kit) licensed under MIT License.
```

